*Proof.* Following the defining recursion for append mem concat and applying the preceding component lemmas yields the claimed result. ∎

**Theorem (`concat_assoc`).** The binary operation concat assoc is associative.

*Proof.* Reassociate the three word concatenations in witnesses for concat assoc; this converts membership on either side into membership on the other. ∎

**Theorem (`mulElem_assoc`).** The binary operation mul elem assoc is associative.

*Proof.* Reassociate the three word concatenations in witnesses for mul elem assoc; this converts membership on either side into membership on the other. ∎

