**Theorem (`repeatWord_eq_empty`).** The set or language in repeat word eq empty is empty exactly under the stated absence-of-witness condition.

*Proof.* An element of the set in repeat word eq empty would provide exactly the forbidden witness, while any such witness produces an element; hence emptiness is equivalent to its absence. ∎

